  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">(33 fotos) Recientemente se celebr&oacute; en Onda una reuni&oacute;n de negocios, basada en el m&eacute;todo de Networking de BNI (Business Network International). El evento fue organizado por el grupo BNI Conecta,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">fundado en Onda el 1 de Julio de 2017,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">y sus miembros&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">han rebasado en ese tiempo 1,3 Millones de euros en negocio fruto de sus recomendaciones.</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reuniobnionda/img_4551.jpg\" alt=\"img_4551\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reuniobnionda/img_4553.jpg\" alt=\"img_4553\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reuniobnionda/img_4554.jpg\" alt=\"img_4554\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reuniobnionda/img_4555.jpg\" alt=\"img_4555\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reuniobnionda/img_4557.jpg\" alt=\"img_4557\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reuniobnionda/img_4558.jpg\" alt=\"img_4558\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reuniobnionda/img_4559.jpg\" alt=\"img_4559\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reuniobnionda/img_4560.jpg\" alt=\"img_4560\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" 